PREAMBLE

This is the source code of the Resurgence World of Warcraft addon. Although
the source is publicly visible on GitHub (axelrodd123/Resurgence) for
transparency and audit purposes, it is NOT open source. The author retains
all rights to the code, the brand, the logo, and the curated aura library.

Reading the code is allowed. Modifying, redistributing, or building derivative
works is not.

PERMITTED USES

You may :

  1. Download the official distributed package (the zip published on
     CurseForge or the GitHub Releases page) and install it inside your
     personal World of Warcraft client.

  2. Run the addon as part of your normal WoW gameplay, including in groups
     and guilds, on any number of personal characters and accounts.

  3. Share the official, unmodified zip with other players for the sole
     purpose of helping them install Resurgence.

  4. Read the source code on GitHub for educational and audit purposes.

  5. Submit bug reports and feature suggestions via GitHub Issues.

PROHIBITED USES

You may NOT, without explicit prior written permission from AxelRodd :

  1. Modify, alter, translate, port, or create derivative works based on
     the source code, the configuration files, the textures, the icons,
     the logo, or the curated aura database.

  2. Redistribute the addon under any name other than its original name,
     or in any package other than the official zip published by AxelRodd.

  3. Reverse-engineer, decompile, or disassemble the addon for the purpose
     of creating a competing addon, replicating its features, or extracting
     the curated content.

  4. Sell, sublicense, rent, lease, or otherwise commercially exploit the
     addon, its assets, its name, or its brand.

  5. Use the Resurgence name, logo, or branding to endorse, promote, or
     market any other software product.

  6. Remove, obscure, or alter the copyright notice, the author signature,
     or the license file in any redistributed copy.

